type: software
title: "CI/CD Pipeline Compromise Lab"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible lab that demonstrates real-world attacks against GitHub
  Actions pipelines, detects them with Sigma rules and automated scanners,
  hardens the pipelines, and proves the hardening works through automated
  verification.
